ApiResultObject.description:
Represents a standard API response structure, providing status, message, data, timestamp, and extensible fields.

Example usage:
```ts
const result: ApiResult = {
  code: 'S',
  msg: 'Operation successful',
  data: { id: 1, name: 'test' },
  datetime: new Date(),
  ext: { traceId: 'abc123' }
};
```

